    <item>
      <title>Getting Started with CCASH</title>
      <link>https://cca.sh/knowledge/guides/getting-started/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://cca.sh/knowledge/guides/getting-started/</guid>
      <description>&lt;nav class=&#34;guide-nav&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h4&gt;In This Guide&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;            &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#overview&#34;&gt;Platform Overview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#issuers&#34;&gt;For Issuers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#investors&#34;&gt;For Investors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#brokers&#34;&gt;For Brokers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#verification&#34;&gt;Verification Process&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#support&#34;&gt;Getting Help&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/nav&gt;&#xA;        &lt;section id=&#34;overview&#34; class=&#34;guide-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h2&gt;Platform Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;CCASH is a compliant platform for issuing, investing in, and distributing &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;security-token&#34;&gt;security tokens&lt;/span&gt;. We combine blockchain efficiency with traditional finance compliance to offer the best of both worlds.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;            &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Issuers:&lt;/strong&gt; Tokenize assets, raise capital globally, manage cap tables automatically&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investors:&lt;/strong&gt; Access curated offerings, choose your custody model, receive automated distributions&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brokers:&lt;/strong&gt; Expand your product offering, earn competitive commissions, serve global clients&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h3&gt;Key Features&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;            &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliant by design:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;reg-d&#34;&gt;Reg D 506(c)&lt;/span&gt; / &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;reg-s&#34;&gt;Reg S&lt;/span&gt; framework with full &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;kyc&#34;&gt;KYC&lt;/span&gt;/&lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;aml&#34;&gt;AML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid custody:&lt;/strong&gt; Self-custody on &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;solana&#34;&gt;Solana&lt;/span&gt; or institutional via &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;clearstream&#34;&gt;Clearstream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wyoming DAO LLC:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;wyoming-dao-llc&#34;&gt;Legal entity recognition&lt;/span&gt; with &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;series-llc&#34;&gt;Series LLC&lt;/span&gt; protection&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secondary trading:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;secondary-trading&#34;&gt;Compliant peer-to-peer transfers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/section&gt;&#xA;        &lt;section id=&#34;issuers&#34; class=&#34;guide-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h2&gt;For Issuers&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;Launch a tokenized securities offering in weeks, not months. Here&#39;s how to get started:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Investor Eligibility Guide</title>
      <link>https://cca.sh/knowledge/guides/investor-eligibility/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://cca.sh/knowledge/guides/investor-eligibility/</guid>
      <description>&lt;nav class=&#34;guide-nav&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h4&gt;In This Guide&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;            &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#who-can-invest&#34;&gt;Who Can Invest?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#investor-classifications&#34;&gt;Investor Classifications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#verification-process&#34;&gt;The Verification Process&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#regulatory-exemptions&#34;&gt;Regulatory Exemptions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#geographic-eligibility&#34;&gt;Geographic Eligibility&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#minimum-requirements&#34;&gt;Minimum Requirements&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/nav&gt;&#xA;        &lt;section id=&#34;who-can-invest&#34; class=&#34;guide-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h2&gt;Who Can Invest?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;CCASH offerings are private placements - regulated securities sold under specific exemptions from public registration. This means not everyone can invest. There are rules, and these rules are not suggestions. They are federal law.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;The &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;security-token&#34;&gt;security tokens&lt;/span&gt; on our platform are offered under &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;reg-d&#34;&gt;Reg D&lt;/span&gt; (US investors) and &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;reg-s&#34;&gt;Reg S&lt;/span&gt; (non-US investors) exemptions. Your eligibility depends on three factors:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>ISIN Conversion Guide</title>
      <link>https://cca.sh/knowledge/guides/isin-conversion/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://cca.sh/knowledge/guides/isin-conversion/</guid>
      <description>&lt;nav class=&#34;guide-nav&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h4&gt;In This Guide&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;            &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#what-is-isin&#34;&gt;What Is an ISIN?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#crossconversion-process&#34;&gt;The CrossConversion Process&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cross-to-bankable&#34;&gt;Cross to Bankable&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#cross-to-onchain&#34;&gt;Cross to On-Chain&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#one-to-one-invariant&#34;&gt;The 1:1 Invariant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#reconciliation-trust&#34;&gt;Reconciliation &amp; Trust&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fees-timeline&#34;&gt;Fees &amp; Timeline&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#when-to-convert&#34;&gt;When to Convert&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/nav&gt;&#xA;        &lt;section id=&#34;what-is-isin&#34; class=&#34;guide-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h2&gt;What Is an ISIN?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;An &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;isin&#34;&gt;ISIN&lt;/span&gt; (International Securities Identification Number) is a 12-character alphanumeric code that uniquely identifies a financial instrument globally. It is the lingua franca of traditional finance - every stock, bond, and fund share traded through conventional infrastructure has one.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Tokenization 101</title>
      <link>https://cca.sh/knowledge/guides/tokenization-101/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://cca.sh/knowledge/guides/tokenization-101/</guid>
      <description>&lt;nav class=&#34;guide-nav&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h4&gt;In This Guide&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;            &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#what-is-tokenization&#34;&gt;What Is Tokenization?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#why-tokenize&#34;&gt;Why Tokenize?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#how-ccash-tokenizes&#34;&gt;How CCASH Tokenizes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#token-lifecycle&#34;&gt;The Token Lifecycle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#asset-types&#34;&gt;Asset Types&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#getting-started&#34;&gt;Getting Started&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/nav&gt;&#xA;        &lt;section id=&#34;what-is-tokenization&#34; class=&#34;guide-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;h2&gt;What Is Tokenization?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;Tokenization is the process of representing ownership of a real-world asset as a digital token on a blockchain. A &lt;span class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; data-term=&#34;security-token&#34;&gt;security token&lt;/span&gt; is not a cryptocurrency - it is a regulated financial instrument that happens to live on a distributed ledger instead of in a spreadsheet at a transfer agent&#39;s office.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
